    "summary": "The errata makes these changes to **Belisarius Cawl**:\n\n- He gains the **MOBILE** keyword and a Move of 8\".\n- [Canticles of the Omnissiah](vsdata:ability/adeptus-mechanicus.belisarius-cawl.canticles-of-the-omnissiah): as your Command phase starts, pick 1 ability from the Canticles of the Omnissiah section, which he has until your next Command phase starts.\n- [Invocation of Machine Vengeance](vsdata:ability/adeptus-mechanicus.belisarius-cawl.invocation-of-machine-vengeance-aura): as your Command phase starts, pick 1 enemy unit as your Machine Vengeance target until your next Command phase starts; the **Hit roll** of each attack a friendly **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS** model makes against it may be re-rolled.\n- [Mantra of Discipline](vsdata:ability/adeptus-mechanicus.belisarius-cawl.mantra-of-discipline): he gains the **BATTLELINE** keyword plus Binharic Courage (Aura), which gives friendly **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS** units no more than 6\" from him +1 Objective Control on their models and +1 to their Battle-shock and Leadership tests.\n- [Shroudpsalm (Aura)](vsdata:ability/adeptus-mechanicus.belisarius-cawl.shroudpsalm-aura): friendly **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS** units no more than 6\" from him have **[Stealth](vsdata:core-ability/stealth)**.\n- **Solar atomiser**: 3 attacks and D6 Damage.",
